	'weakly and sat on the floor.'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_0358e:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s wrong, old man?'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_035fe:
	ZH 1:
	'I feel tired...'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_0358e:
	ZH 1:
	'That so?'
	\L_036b3:
	ZH 1:
	'This looks pretty strong,'
	R
	'though. It’s cool.'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_035fe:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah～, yes...'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_03636:
	ZH 1:
	'Omega pushed itself back up.'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_0358e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	R
	'What is it?'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_035fe:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve decided. I’ll return to'
	R
	'my original body. Good god...'
	R
	'I have to go back to that'
	R
	'freezing place again...'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_0358e:
	ZH 1:
	'You could just stay like that,'
	R
	'in that case.'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_035fe:
	ZH 1:
	'No.'
	R
	'Aah... I’m so disappointed...'
	R
	'Aah... I’m tired...'
	R
	'Heave...'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_03660:
	\L_03636:
	ZH 1:
	'Toushin Omega swayed left and'
	R
	'right as it left the throne.'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_0358e:
	ZH 1:
	'...What’s with him...?'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
	\L_035c6:
	ZH 1:
	'Freak left Leazas Castle on a'
	R
	'journey once again.'
	\L_036b3:
	\L_036a6:
